  "historyNote": "#10801, eff 5-17-15; ss by #13667, eff 6-22-23 (formerly Per 102.52); renumbered by #14065-A; ss by #14132-A, eff 11-27-24 (formerly Per 102.63); ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.68), eff 12-1-25",
