  "prefLabel": "Per 102.78 Reemployment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.78 “Reemployment” means the assignment by the appointing authority of a laid off former full-time employee who was laid off more than 3 years ago or a full-time employee who was demoted in lieu of layoff to a position within the agency in a classification other than that from which the employee was laid off.\n\nSource. #10801, eff 5-17-15; ss by #13667, eff 6-22-23 (formerly Per 102.52); renumbered by #14065-A; ss by #14132-A, eff 11-27-24 (formerly Per 102.63); ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.68), eff 12-1-25",
